	(text "LAYOUT NOTE:\nKeep the 220 uF electrolytic on MODEM_3V3_SW,\nafter the AP22814, physically near the mPCIe\nmodem connector. \nIt supplies RF burst current locally while\nleaving the buck’s control-loop capacitor\nbank ceramic and within TI’s recommended range."
